Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a story about a slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One day, the slime that Tia brought here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to purify our waste water and\Nsewage started to multiply,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and now there are lots of different types\Nof slimes that are all different colors here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were all harmless,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I didn't really notice\Nthat they'd been multiplying, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did it drink an entire barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A single slime drank it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even my dad can only drink\Nhalf a barrel at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That alcohol was everyone's property!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't go and drink it\Nwithout our permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This deserves a severe punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,P-please wait a minute, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's all calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This came as a big shock to\Nall the alcohol-loving residents here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so began our village's first trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, um...\N{\rSubtitle-2}Let's burn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:00:58.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If we need fire, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.92,0:00:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Guilty.\N{\rSubtitle-2}If we need fire, leave it to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...\N{\rSubtitle-2}If we need fire, leave it to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NAre we blowing something up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:03.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, let's dry it out in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:05.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,No, let's dry it out in the sun!\N{\rSubtitle}Well, I feel bad for the poor thing,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}so let's move away from the barbaric options...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I feel bad for the poor thing,\Nso let's move away from the barbaric options...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.79,0:01:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about we go with a\Nshort confinement as a punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that was our precious alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, this kind of stuff happens\Nbecause you're too soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.54,0:01:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, everyone?\NWe're talking about a slime here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if we punish it, I'm not sure\Nthat it's going to reflect on its actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is a slime, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:29.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And so, that slime was acquitted.\N{\rSubtitle}I got a little too fired up back there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:29.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And so, that slime was acquitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:35.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After that, it began to pop up during our feasts\Nand celebrations so that it could join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh well. I think it's alright\Nif we have one slime like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too many would be a problem, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:02:01.75,Song,,0,0,0,,When you open your eyes and see\Nthat pure white light, the story begins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:08.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Stepping forth into a new world,\Nwhat kind of flowers will we make bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:16.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if it's cloudy,\Neven if we get dirty from a puddle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:18.88,Song,,0,0,0,,We continue on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:25.63,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a future we can't imagine\Nwaiting for us, I'm sure of it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:29.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Meeting, meeting, and connecting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:32.83,Song,,0,0,0,,If you smile,\Neveryone around you will smile too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:36.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's plant a small seed and nurture it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:40.96,Song,,0,0,0,,One day it'll become a large flower
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:44.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Turn regrets and failures into fuel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:47.75,Song,,0,0,0,,So that you're overflowing with colorful happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:51.96,Song,,0,0,0,,We'll join hands and share
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:57.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Spread across the world, Flower Ring
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The season is autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The summers here aren't\Nparticularly hot or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's still nice when things cool down a bit\Nand we can get some more work done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And here's the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is making me hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Autumn means eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop taking all the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.25,0:03:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm eating vegetables, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are all new types of mushrooms\Nthat we didn't have in Howling Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, I really love hot pots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we could get seafood here,\Nthese would taste even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:04:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you referring to\Nwhen you say seafood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stuff like cod or crabs or monkfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can make broth from kombu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then we could make a chanco hotpot with miso!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Start researching those things immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've found information on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do I do?\NI've never even seen the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you say crabs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you eat those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:22.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're really hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kombu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds like something terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:27.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Broth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the soup-like thing you showed me\Nhow to prepare earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.67,0:04:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is chanco a kind of fish, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we need ocean access,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's a port city within the boundaries\Nof the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can reach it if you\Nhead south from this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They do a lot of trading of ocean products,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we might be able to find those fish there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll fly over and check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can ask a merchant I know for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's get started right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the miso!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They all really like hotpots, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When it comes to food, everyone here\Ngets very motivated to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, nothing makes me happier as a farmer\Nthan seeing them happily enjoying my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, the return of the group\Nthat set out in earnest took place...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,3 days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a merchant from the city of Shashato\Nin the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:33.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the mayor, Hiraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming\Nall the way here to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:40.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is part of my job as a merchant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are the marine products\NI brought from the city of Shashato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They are our pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With regards to the seaweed\Ncalled kombu that you requested,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,our fishermen normally throw it\Nback into the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,even if they pull some up in their nets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have my men collect some right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have it dried and ready before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:03.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With regards to my visit here today,\NI have three main goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The first is to properly greet you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and thank you for requesting\Nto do business with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The second is to suggest more opportunities\Nfor us to trade goods and do business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And my third goal, if possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is to become the official government\Npurveyor for this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Official government purveyor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It means he wants to handle all trade\Nbetween us and the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're being quite direct\Nin what you're asking us for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm always careful to not be so indirect\Nthat my intentions are misinterpreted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All of the crops you have here\Nare very enticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you allow me the opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can get you several times more value\Nwhen trading them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people who want\Nto do trade with this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As I said, if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask that you first\Nhave a look at a list of the products
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that my company handles the trading of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And from there,\Nwe can discuss my proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We were able to cover a lot of\Nimportant ground with today's talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'd like it if we were able to\Ndiscuss the alcohol produced in this village...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't have the alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:29.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll leave things here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:35.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, he seemed like\Na skilled merchant, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.25,0:07:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll be a big help having him\Nhandle our negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And even though he's handling things for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we'll end up getting more goods\Nwhen we trade now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really didn't seem like he had\Nany intention of trying to deceive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:50.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I hope our relationship with him\Ngoes smoothly from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seemed like he was\Nreally frightened there at the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's to be expected\Nwhen you're talking to a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.04,0:08:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Great Tree Village, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A visitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Without an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'd like to talk business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:32.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be any busier now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My name is Michael Goroun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I work as the head of the largest\Ntrading company in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's nothing major,\Ncan't you guys handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do they need to see me specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They requested you by name\Nwhen they arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've even brought goods from their farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They already brought goods with them?\NDon't they know the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you guys can't handle it on your own,\Nthen just refer them somewhere el-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I'll meet with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:05.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My merchant's intuition is telling me\Nthat I can't ignore this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.67,0:09:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This strange feeling\Nwelling up inside of me is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:17.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the last time we had the pleasure of meeting\Nwas at your birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the young lady of\Nthe Chrome family is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My head would have rolled\Nif I'd have sent her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And who have you brought with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:39.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lastismoon of the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please call me Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:42.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lastismoon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could she really be that crazy dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's just a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The daughter of one of the most powerful\Nfamilies of the Demonic Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:54.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and a dangerous dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:57.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The risks of trading with them are too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:10:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So what brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I can't just ignore them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to purchase these from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And in exchange for them,\Nthere are some things we'd like you to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm being stared down by a dragon\Nwhile being surrounded by lizardmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm about to enter\Nsome outrageous trade talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that feeling I had before\Na warning of impending danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,those fruit that have entered\Nthe Demonic Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that people have been talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Each one of these\Ncan fetch several silver coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.50,0:10:39.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And look how many they've brought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The goods you wanted\Nwere from the ocean, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.75,0:10:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This port is my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:51.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can find you whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:53.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the job of a merchant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't let this chance get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey you. Go to the port and bring me\Ntheir best catches from this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And after that begin preparing\Nfor me to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:10.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take part in the delivery myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are the goods going to the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, they're going to The Great Tree Village\Nin The Forest of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll carry the stuff,\Nso I can give you a ride too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forest of Death?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give me a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a merchant from Shashato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:35.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, the merchant came with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The mayor seems normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't have the alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I survived it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I managed to finish my business\Nwith that terrifying group
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,while having a smile on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was the best deal of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huge profits are waiting for me\Nfrom here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if my body can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here it is, real seafood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe next time I'll ask him\Nfor shrimp or squid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the third time a dragon\Nhas attacked this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this one related to Dryme again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the record, the three angel squad\Nin charge of patrolling the skies
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was quickly able to spot this dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However stopping a dragon\Nproved to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But seriously, what is that dragon doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Acting smug?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you're challenging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want a fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.25,0:13:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I missed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...is what I want them to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:21.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, you got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well you see,\Nit really isn't that big of an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you burned the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then, just give me a minute\Nand I'll come up with
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,a super important reason why I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, mayor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's little Drymey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Little?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to Dryme's explanation,\Nher name is Hakuren.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's his older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said you were giving away\NLasty as a bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.17,0:14:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bride?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You totally said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.71,0:14:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to marry her off\Nto the mayor of this village someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dryme?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I might have said something kind of like that\Nwhile I was drinking, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:24.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll do it one day for the prosperity of our tribe!\N{\rSubtitle}I might have said something kind of like that{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}while I was drinking, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:27.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll do it one day for the prosperity of our tribe!\N{\rSubtitle}As the person in question,{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}it makes it really hard to comment on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:27.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the person in question,\Nit makes it really hard to comment on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that's why I came out here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to see what kind of person\Nhe was marrying her off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then why couldn't you just\Ncome visit normally?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone always talks about\Nhow strong the mayor here is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I wanted to come play with you a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's mostly here to vent anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.21,0:14:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could just let it slide
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:51.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that my little niece is going to find\Na husband before I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean come on,\Nshe's 900 years younger than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:58.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you agre-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine if you want to come play,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you shouldn't be causing\Nproblems for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it goes without saying, that you're\Ngoing to clean up this mess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:09.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it!\N{\rSubtitle}And it goes without saying, that you're{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}going to clean up this mess, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you two are always eating food\Nthat tastes this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not always\Nimposing on everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Only about three out of every ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's five days...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:24.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She's already fitting in...\N{\rSubtitle}Maybe it's five days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:24.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,She's already fitting in...\N{\rSubtitle}Five days?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Five days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that my aunt is-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:30.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:33.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...that Big Sis Hakuren\Nis causing so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing you need to\Napologize about, Lasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh right, I heard you have some\Nreally fun games here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like the one where you line up\Nthe little square things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean mahjong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You play with four people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey mayor, let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave here\Nonly having lost to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, first let me explain the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:58.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:15:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But more importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,what should we bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.25,0:16:08.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This way it's more fun\Nthan just playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:14.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think we should take it easy at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What would you normally bet\Nwhen playing mahjong like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if you want me to bet something,\NI don't really have anything I can bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So then should we have\Na punishment for the loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can think to do\Nis play strip mahjong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So the loser gets a taste of humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no, I don't want to force anyone\Nto do anything they don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right, Lasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:40.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we're competing,\Nthen there's no way I can lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Lasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...as a member of the dragon clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that\Nthings are going to get bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's chii!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's riichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too bad... ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is my fault for carelessly\Nsuggesting this idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is indeed shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dragons are all very competitive,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:10.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Aw, I was so close.\N{\rSubtitle}and they can't stand losing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.75,0:17:13.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going!\N{\rSubtitle}This led to a very serious game{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}of strip mahjong starting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're new to this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you're wearing the least clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are you so confident?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this,\NI wanted to carefully rack up some points
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and end things while maintaining\Nthe peace, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,something isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How am I losing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm on my last piece of clothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're using\Nsome kind of magic trickery?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are they using telekinesis to rewrite the tiles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can they see through the back of my tiles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.25,0:17:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything written on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it an extra?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm overthinking it.\N{\rSubtitle}Some tiles are just like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.54,0:17:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my chance has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can score a double yakuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.25,0:17:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can end the whole thing\Nwith a single move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:17:59.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,of course it had to be this tile again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll never beat the dragons\Nif I'm paralyzed by fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, pants off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:18.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pants off! Pants off! Pants off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.21,0:18:20.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pants off! Pants off! Pants off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The dragons are gathering\Nin that village again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. The ancient dragon Hakuren\Nwas spotted as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:35.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way... They're got enough power\Nto conquer a whole country now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.29,0:18:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we afford to simply sit back and watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly, Beezel...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:44.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes. Do you have an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's my daughter.\NShe's been in a bad mood lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:52.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She hasn't said anything to me all day\Nbesides good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this her rebellious phase?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyways... we need to focus on\Npreparing our military forces immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll need to secure the funds we need-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I resign. Signed Randan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:01.29,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Randan?!\N{\rSubtitle}I resign. Signed Randan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I resign. Signed Randan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, he ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So if you divide these apples\Nbetween three people,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how many apples will you have to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really wish I could just them all, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's really come into her own here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After attacking The Great Tree Village,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hakuren decided to stay here\Nfor the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:27.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, she's very skilled\Nand able to handle any job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:29.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There we go. Nice and easy.\N{\rSubtitle}Surprisingly, she's very skilled{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}and able to handle any job here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:30.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,There we go. Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But she complains about\Nanything she's asked to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Every time I turn around,\Nshe's in her room doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why do you complain so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm hoping that one day maybe people\Nwill stop asking me to do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to order her to start\Ndigging holes and then filling them back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:48.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay, enough! I give up!\N{\rSubtitle}I had no choice but to order her to start{\r}\N{\rSubtitle}digging holes and then filling them back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Okay, enough! I give up!\N{\rSubtitle}She gave up on day one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the end we settled on her teaching\Nreading, writing, and math.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She became the village teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's why learning to\Nread, write, and do math,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,will help you all a lot\Nin your day to day lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.29,0:20:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen up, I want all of you\Nto work really hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:06.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so that one day I don't have to\Nwork anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.42,0:20:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think her motivation\Nmight not be the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.21,0:20:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, we beg of you to spare our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:19.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to the lamia girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,at some point, the younger animals
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,decided to clear a dungeon they found\Nin the middle of the forest..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.71,0:20:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And then the lamia were forced to\Nquickly flee their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They didn't know what they were doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but they still caused the girls\Na lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They came all the way here\Nto seek our aid and protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think it would be proper\Nto turn them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the end, we decided to trade\Nthe precious gems the lamia mined
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,for some of our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.63,0:20:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After that, they went back to\Ntheir original homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:21:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if we could\Nkeep trading from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!\NJust ask us for whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're so genuinely excited about this\Nthat it's making me awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I have something\NI'd like to request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine if it's only when\Nyou're visiting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'd appreciate it if you could\Nput some clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That might be part of their culture,\Nbut I really had trouble not staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After that, the lamia formed\Nthe Lamia Delivery Service
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and started carrying\Nour trading goods for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With everything said and done,\NI'm glad we found some reliable neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Between this and the increased trade\Nwith other cities and areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:38.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it really feels like the village\Nhas reached a new level.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Since we've increased\Nthe amount of trade we're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how about we plant more crops?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.46,0:21:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It appears that village is indeed\Namassing military might
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and planning something foul!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They may be convincing\NFlowrem to stay there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so that they can use her as\Na hostage if they need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should begin gathering\Nour troops at once, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We must defeat that village\Nand save Flowrem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.17,0:22:38.92,Song,,0,0,0,,I can feel the soft seasonal winds,\Ngently on my fingertips
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:47.83,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's search for what we love\Nin the clouds floating in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.83,0:22:52.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Forget about the hands of the clock for now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.63,0:22:57.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Try taking one deep breath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:06.67,Song,,0,0,0,,The rainbow-colored scenery\Nwill resonate with my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.00,Song,,0,0,0,,I'm sure any wish I have will come true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:17.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Because you're by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:22.13,Song,,0,0,0,,You make every day feel like a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:26.92,Song,,0,0,0,,At that warm and kind place
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:34.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Keep showing me your smiling face forever
